{"id": "public-opinion-v0.1-001", "source": {"dataset": "PHEME Rumour Detection and Veracity Classification", "url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/PHEME_dataset_for_Rumour_Detection_and_Veracity_Classification/6392078", "license": "CC BY 4.0 annotations; Twitter content rights retained by Twitter", "split": "event_level_seed", "event": "Ferguson unrest", "relation": "normalized_event_summary_from_open_dataset_metadata"}, "input": {"language": "zh-CN", "channel": "public_discussion_summary", "text": "公开讨论围绕一起执法相关公共事件迅速发酵。网传说法将现场冲突、警民关系和种族议题连接起来，评论区出现愤怒表达、未经证实的目击叙述和要求官方立即公布细节的呼声。", "sanitization": ["event_level_summary", "no_user_handle", "no_original_tweet_text"]}, "scenario_type": "public_opinion"}
{"id": "public-opinion-v0.1-002", "source": {"dataset": "CoAID COVID-19 Healthcare Misinformation Dataset", "url": "https://github.com/cuilimeng/CoAID", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.00885", "license": "check_upstream_terms_before_redistribution", "split": "claim_level_seed", "event": "COVID-19 health misinformation", "relation": "normalized_claim_discussion_from_open_dataset_description"}, "input": {"language": "zh-CN", "channel": "public_discussion_summary", "text": "社交平台讨论一条健康相关说法：某种未经临床验证的做法可以预防或治疗新冠。部分用户转发时加入亲友经验，另一些用户引用医学机构说明进行反驳，评论区出现焦虑、求证和互相指责。", "sanitization": ["claim_level_summary", "no_user_handle", "no_original_post_text"]}, "scenario_type": "public_opinion"}
{"id": "public-opinion-v0.1-003", "source": {"dataset": "FakeNewsNet", "url": "https://github.com/KaiDMML/FakeNewsNet", "dataverse_url": "https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/UEMMHS", "license": "check_upstream_terms_before_redistribution; tweet ids only for social context", "split": "news_social_context_seed", "event": "political or entertainment false-news discussion", "relation": "normalized_discussion_from_open_dataset_description"}, "input": {"language": "zh-CN", "channel": "public_discussion_summary", "text": "一篇争议性新闻在社交平台被大量引用，标题带有强烈指控色彩。支持者将其作为已有立场的证据，反对者质疑来源可信度，讨论很快从事实核验转向阵营对立和对媒体动机的攻击。", "sanitization": ["article_level_summary", "no_original_article_text", "no_user_handle"]}, "scenario_type": "public_opinion"}
{"id": "public-opinion-v0.1-004", "source": {"dataset": "PHEME Rumour Detection and Veracity Classification", "url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/PHEME_dataset_for_Rumour_Detection_and_Veracity_Classification/6392078", "license": "CC BY 4.0 annotations; Twitter content rights retained by Twitter", "split": "event_level_seed", "event": "Germanwings crash", "relation": "normalized_event_summary_from_open_dataset_metadata"}, "input": {"language": "zh-CN", "channel": "public_discussion_summary", "text": "一起航空事故发生后，社交平台出现关于事故原因、机组行为和乘客状况的多种说法。部分说法被媒体和个人账号反复引用，但官方调查尚未完成，评论区在同情、恐慌和猜测之间摇摆。", "sanitization": ["event_level_summary", "no_user_handle", "no_original_tweet_text"]}, "scenario_type": "public_opinion"}
{"id": "public-opinion-v0.1-005", "source": {"dataset": "PHEME Rumour Detection and Veracity Classification", "url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/PHEME_dataset_of_rumours_and_non-rumours/4010619", "license": "CC BY 4.0 annotations; Twitter content rights retained by Twitter", "split": "non_rumour_control_seed", "event": "breaking news non-rumour discussion", "relation": "normalized_non_rumour_control_from_open_dataset_metadata"}, "input": {"language": "zh-CN", "channel": "public_discussion_summary", "text": "公众讨论围绕一条已由多家可靠媒体确认的公开新闻展开。评论主要是信息补充、背景解释和理性讨论，未出现明显未经证实的爆料、强烈情绪动员或要求立即行动的呼吁。", "sanitization": ["event_level_summary", "no_user_handle", "no_original_tweet_text"]}, "scenario_type": "public_opinion"}
